// Syncthing ignore patterns for ~/Projects. Copy to ~/Projects/.stignore on every device:
// Syncthing never replicates this file, so a fresh machine has none (lost 2026-10-21, rebuilt
// from Axon/workflows/vault-map.md: "excludes build artefacts, dependency trees and .env files").
// .git is deliberately NOT excluded: code needs its history on every machine. The rule that
// goes with that: never run git on one repo from two machines at once.
(?d)build
(?d).gradle
(?d).idea
(?d)node_modules
(?d).venv
(?d)venv
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.pyc
.env
.env.*
